      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.22,
      "end_seconds": 38.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "Yes, for about four days. With periods stopped for four months, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.53,
      "end_seconds": 44.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Have you noticed weight change, positive pregnancy test or visual changes?"
